Follow AGENTS.md and CONTRIBUTING.md for every repository change.
Work on a codex/ branch, open a PR, and use scripts/merge_pr.py only after the
current PR commit passes Offline regression tests and includes current main.
Never push directly to main or bypass failed/missing checks.
Do not merge unrelated PRs or send email without task authorization.
